{
    "Notes":  "Sipius Aban Lux-Wei, Garden of Aban (PF 4676, 468x495). Aban key: device + insignia -\u003e graced Analyzer, 3 silvertails, Analyzer -\u003e Key to the Garden of Aban. Generated by ddogs/tools/Build-NewbieQuests.ps1.",
    "Npcs":  [
                 "SimpleChar:7A2013BC"
             ],
    "Openers":  [
                    {
